        "point": "ε < 0",
        "statement": "When ε < 0 and r > 0, the bound ε * r is negative; since norms are non-negative the set VTask.A f L r ε is empty for any f whose increments are not identically equal to those of the linear map h ↦ h • L.",
        "note": "No special junk value is declared; the formula is applied as stated."
      }
